Local geographic reference data:
GeoNames, German postal-code dataset (https://www.geonames.org/export/zip/),
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).
Source mirror: https://github.com/symerio/postal-codes-data
Pinned commit: 3a94317a6192e7e576c078538dfe665048d42edf
Source blob: 4e72dcb0a6806f8bc526929a6b12a90afd54532b (data/geonames/DE.txt).
Modified for local use: selected DE rows with a five-digit postal code,
state and valid regional coordinates; retained postal code, place name,
state code, latitude and longitude as TSV (16,476 rows, 8,307 postcodes).
The app computes approximate area centers; neither the dataset nor the
result represents an exact listing address. No profile data is in the file.
